cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book, app, or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Artificial Neural Networks — A Visual, Hands-On Course (with the ANN Studio companion app)"
abstract: >-
  A complete, self-contained course on artificial neural networks and deep
  learning, taught in a read-it, see-it, run-it style. It ships with ANN
  Studio, a free companion app that runs live Python (NumPy and PyTorch) in the
  browser, plus every code example and the full editable source of both the
  book and the app.
type: book
authors:
